{"id":"n61338-1-7","stage":3,"title":"늘리다 · 使增大","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61338-1-7-1","ko":"근데 이 바지의 통이 좀 좁은 것 같아요.","zh":"不过，这条裤子的裤管好像有点窄。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"근데","meaning":"可是，但是","explanation":"근데：可是，但是。","readings":[{"term":"근데","audio":"/audio/9429d8c1a056112b539d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36013","senseId":"1","lemma":"근데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근데","audio":"/audio/9429d8c1a056112b539d.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"바지의","meaning":"裤子","explanation":"바지：裤子；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"바지","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66249","senseId":"1","lemma":"바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바지의","audio":"/audio/06acca09074424e9e76b.mp3"}},{"text":"통이","meaning":"粗细，肥瘦，胖瘦","explanation":"통：粗细，肥瘦，胖瘦；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"통","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81472","senseId":"1","lemma":"통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통이","audio":"/audio/42604f379b41608aa67b.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"좁은","meaning":"窄，狭窄","explanation":"좁다：窄，狭窄；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"2","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좁은","audio":"/audio/297601336491988195c4.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9429d8c1a056112b","term":"근데","zh":"可是，但是","audio":"/audio/9429d8c1a056112b539d.mp3","entryId":"36013","definition":"用于说与前面内容相反的内容。","pronunciation":["근데"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"fb24dd66a8c8c7dd","term":"바지","zh":"裤子","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3","entryId":"66249","definition":"穿在下身的衣物，上面为筒状，下面是可以放腿的两条分叉。","pronunciation":["바지"]},{"id":"837d5d028930fb39","term":"통","zh":"粗细，肥瘦，胖瘦","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3","entryId":"81472","definition":"袖子或裤筒等的内径。","pronunciation":["통"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"19959a056b2a4242","term":"좁다","zh":"窄，狭窄","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3","entryId":"75801","definition":"路的宽度或物体与物体间的距离较短。","pronunciation":["좁따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076",